        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "15-7-4 Any courses for which the above criteria do not apply, or course work secured from a two (2)-year junior college or community college, may be accorded credit for advancement of the salary schedule only upon application and approval by the Division of Instruction. This application must include a description of the course, including course number, sponsoring school and credit value, with a statement explaining how the course will enhance the value of the individual's service function.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
